			<div class="content" id="post-content-2822237">
									

<p>After a lot of critique, I present to you SCP-2687, my first SCP.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ludwigtheperplexing" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2749601); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2749601&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1494900342" alt="LudwigThePerplexing" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2749601)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ludwigtheperplexing" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2749601); return false;">LudwigThePerplexing</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dann2442" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2193882); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2193882&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1494900342" alt="Dann2442" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2193882)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dann2442" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2193882); return false;">Dann2442</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tretter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1422059); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1422059&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1494900342" alt="tretter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1422059)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tretter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1422059); return false;">tretter</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1229263); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1494900342" alt="Roget" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1229263); return false;">Roget</a></span>, and the several others that looked over this.</p>
<p>If you happened to critique this and I, for whatever reason, forgot about you, please PM me. I'll add you to the list.</p>
<p>Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1229263); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1494900342" alt="Roget" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1229263); return false;">Roget</a></span> for giving my permission to add this to the Site-77 hub and giving me some recommendations for what SCPs to use in the first step of the organ creation process.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">A&nbsp;small&nbsp;explanation</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">It's&nbsp;really&nbsp;small</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>After essentially being forced to work for them, Dr. Lienau sees the Foundation the same way the Serpent's Hand sees the GOC: A bunch of idiots that only get in the way.</p>
</div>
