														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4278181">
									

<p>There's an idea that has been spinning around in my head for a few years now, I've thought about it time and time again, in each related-skip I read. I finally decided that I can't keep denying it even to myself: <em>I hate Prometheus Labs</em>. To me they are the most distasteful, drab and outright cringy GoI there is. I've got nothing against the various authors that published skips made by them, it's just that I don't like <strong>them</strong> at all, the idea, their concept. If this skip was related to any other group, even non GoI ones, I wouldn't upvote it either(The Foundation using skips is a major no-no for me). But seeing as it's made by PL, it's a firm downvote for me.</p>
<p>I would recommend a rewrite that severed ties with the GoI and made sure to note that the Foundation doesn't use the &quot;organs&quot;. But that's just personal taste.</p>

